{"id":"eb450e3865639724","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sequent-antecedent.md","title":"Sequent Antecedent","display":"df-sequent-antecedent — Sequent Antecedent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sequent-antecedent","aliases":["72-df-sequent-antecedent"],"display":"df-sequent-antecedent — Sequent Antecedent","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sequent-antecedent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sequent-antecedent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent-antecedent — Sequent Antecedent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(s=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，两侧都是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的有限函数序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ant}(s):=\\pi_1(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{Ant}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle)=\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ant}(s):=\\pi_1(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{Ant}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle)=\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书此接口明确使用序列；集合/多重集变体须用独立载体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$，两侧都是 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的有限函数序列。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ant}(s):=\\pi_1(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{Ant}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle)=\\Gamma.","display":true}],"bytes":930,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-antecedent|df-sequent-antecedent — Sequent Antecedent]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-sequent-antecedent|df-sequent-antecedent — Sequent Antecedent]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117"]}